hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2529","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jis shakhs ney aisa ghulam azad kya jis key paas kuch maal tha to ghulam ka maal bhi us ghulam ka hai illa ye ke Malik uskey maal ki shart laga ley to phir usey mil jaeyga. ( hadees key doosrey Raavi) ibne-Lahiaa ney (apni riwayat mein) ( إِلَّا أَنْ يَشْتَرِطَ السَّيِّدُ ) ki bajaey ( إِلَّا أَنْ يَسْتَثْنِيَهُ"
"2530","Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) key azad karda ghulam Hazrat Umer (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ney un sey kaha : aey Umer ! main tujhey dil ki khushi sey azad karta hun. mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey ye irshad suna hai : jis shakhs ney kisi ghulam ko azad kya aur uskey maal ka zikr na kya to wo maal uska hai. to mujhey bata do ke kon-kon sa maal tumhara hai? Imam Ibne-Maja (Rahimahullah) ney mazkura baala riwayat Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Numer key wastey sey bhi isi tarah bayan ki hai."
"2531","Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki azad karda Hazrat Memuna binte-Saad (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey na jayez talluq key natijey mein paida honey waley (ghulam) key barey mein daryaft kya gaya to aap ney farmaya : na jayez bachey ko azad karney sey to jooton ka wo joda behtar hai jinhen pehan kar mein jihad karun."
"2532","Haddasana Muhammad bin Bashshar, haddasana Hammad bin Masadah; aur haddasana Muhammad bin Khalaf al-Asqalani aur Ishaq bin Mansoor, dono ne kaha: Haddasana Ubaidullah bin Abdul Majeed, haddasana Ubaidullah bin Abdur Rahman bin Abdullah bin Mawhab, Qasim bin Muhammad se, Aisha se ke unke paas ek ghulam aur ek laundi (jawani) the jo aapas mein shadi-shuda the. To unhone (Aisha ne) kaha: Ya Rasool Allah, main in dono ko azaad karna chahti hoon. To Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Agar tum in dono ko azaad karna chaho to pehle mard ko azaad karo phir aurat ko.”"
